      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MACBETH.\nThere’s one did laugh in’s sleep, and one cried, “Murder!”\nThat they did wake each other: I stood and heard them.\nBut they did say their prayers, and address’d them\nAgain to sleep.",
