      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MACBETH.\nOne cried, “God bless us!” and, “Amen,” the other,\nAs they had seen me with these hangman’s hands.\nList’ning their fear, I could not say “Amen,”\nWhen they did say, “God bless us.”",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
