      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MACBETH.\nStill it cried, “Sleep no more!” to all the house:\n“Glamis hath murder’d sleep, and therefore Cawdor\nShall sleep no more. Macbeth shall sleep no more!”",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
